The  driver  manages automatic loading of firmware on the Atheros
AR3011 and AR3012 Bluetooth chipsets.  The firmware files  should
be  obtained  and placed in a directory in the search path of the
kernel subsystem.  Upon attachment, the driver will load the nec‐
essary firmware files and the device will detach and reattach  as
a   generic  Bluetooth  device  using  the  driver.   For  AR3011
